Dear Committee Secretariat,

I write to notify you of Judicial Review proceedings filed in Zahmoul v Sec=
retary of State for Justice & HMCTS (AC-2025-LON-004293).
The claim concerns the enforcement gap identified by Parliament in relation=
 to Autism Act statutory guidance and includes allegations of misadministrat=
ion of electronic material with potential criminal relevance.

Given the Committee=E2=80=99s 2024=E2=80=9325 Inquiry, I provide this update for transp=
arency.

Filed materials are publicly accessible:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Kind regards,
Nadia Zahmoul

=20

